  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム』より、1/60スケールで、シャア専用ザクが登場。",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", Char's Zaku appears in 1/60 scale."
    },
    {
      "ja": "別売のムギ球と単三乾電池２本を使用して、モノアイを点灯させることができます。脚の可動は左右、ハの字開脚と、足首の前後スイングが可能です。手首パーツは通常の握り手の他、ザク・マシンガンのホールド用右握り手、同スケールのシャアのフィギュアを乗せる左手首が付いています。",
      "en": "You can light up the mono-eye using a wheat bulb and two AA batteries (sold separately). The legs can be moved left and right, the legs can be opened in a V-shape, and the ankles can be swung back and forth. In addition to the normal gripping hand, the wrist parts include a right gripping hand for holding the Zaku machine gun, and a left wrist for holding the Char figure of the same scale."
    }
